==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration features the Star Trim of {{p|Furfrou}}.
*{{a|Fur Coat}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Furfrou}} can have.
*'''Quick Blow''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Quick Attack''' on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Sabrina's Abra|94}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Moon}}.

